        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ધરપકડ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ધરપકડ — dharpakaḍ — \"an arrest\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "પોલીસે ગઈકાલે બે ચોરોની ધરપકડ કરી. polīse gaīkāle be coronī dharpakaḍ karī. Yesterday the police arrested two thieves."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A feminine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ધરપકડ (dharpakaḍ) is built from the stem of dharvũ, to hold, from Sanskrit dhárati (CDIAL 6747), and pakaḍ, a grip, the noun of પકડવું: a holding and a seizing. The police ધરપકડ કરે છે, make an arrest."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
