            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "કબૂલવું — kabūlvũ — \"to confess\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ચોરે થાણામાં ગુનો કબૂલ્યો. core thāṇāmā̃ guno kabūlyo. At the police station the thief confessed to the crime."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with તેણે (he or she …): તેણે ગુનો કબૂલ્યો, teṇe guno kabūlyo."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "કબૂલવું (kabūlvũ) is built on kabūl, usually traced through Persian to Arabic qabūl, \"acceptance\": to confess is to accept what you did. ગુનો કબૂલ્યો, he admitted the crime."
            }
          ]
        },
